{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When we arrived at Zahha, we got out of the car with our faces bright.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"See you! Get along, now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you very much!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, thanks for everything!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But, just to be safe. Don't let your guard down until April 8 is over. The 'shinigami' might still be targeting you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It's certain that somebody placed those paper dolls."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Also, the fact that she came to the police today, I haven't told </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Niimura-san's mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> came to the police station on her own and talked on her own. That's all it was, so there's no need to worry about reading </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">her mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s face."</STYLE>
